WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.120
A very warm welcome to this module on fear. False evidence appearing real. So often fear

00:00:09.120 --> 00:00:16.000
lives in our projected future in most cases and it has a structure to it and we're going

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:21.280
to look at that coming up. Now particularly it's normally the perception that whatever

00:00:21.280 --> 00:00:26.880
is we're about to experience we're going to have more negatives or downsides than positives.

00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:31.120
There's a bit of a tip there in the structure but in this upcoming animation that we put together

00:00:31.120 --> 00:00:36.560
once again for athletes we're going to look at the five levels of fear that you can experience.

00:00:36.560 --> 00:00:42.560
Now this is more specifically the five meanings you can give to fear because we do have different

00:00:42.560 --> 00:00:48.800
degrees of fear that's something else such as terror or we might have you know really strong

00:00:48.800 --> 00:00:53.360
fear which is not quite terror we might just have some anxiety strong anxiety we might have some

00:00:53.360 --> 00:00:59.280
just really soft low level anxiety. So you're going to have obviously a gradation or a variation

00:00:59.280 --> 00:01:04.880
on the intensity of the fear you're feeling but then there's the relationship that you have to

00:01:04.880 --> 00:01:11.120
what you're feeling what meaning do you give it. So that's what we're going to look at in the next

00:01:11.120 --> 00:01:15.520
animation and then when we come back from that animation we're going to go in more depth and

00:01:15.520 --> 00:01:21.760
unpack this thing called fear because ultimately when you transform your relationship to fear

00:01:21.760 --> 00:01:25.920
you're going to be able to feel the fear and do it anyway you're going to be able to lean in

00:01:25.920 --> 00:01:32.000
and grow and expand as a person as an individual and that is a good thing. So enjoy and I'll see you

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:34.880
when we come back.